WEBVTT

00:19:28.409 --> 00:19:30.027
SRK: I am not blocking, Ok?

00:19:30.027 --> 00:19:33.317
So if I say left,
you go left.

00:19:33.317 --> 00:19:34.686
SP: Yes.
SRK: Oh lovely.

00:19:34.686 --> 00:19:38.276
So we can do a dance.

00:19:38.276 --> 00:19:40.977
(Applause)

00:19:40.977 --> 00:19:44.357
SRK: OK, One, two, three, four--

00:19:49.404 --> 00:19:55.164
And I will give Sundar my arms
Ah ha ha ha ha ha

00:19:55.164 --> 00:19:58.115
(Applause)

00:19:59.125 --> 00:20:00.565
SRK: Thank you so much.